e most money what was it about his  investing strategy and he said I have  been grateful 1,000 times a day every  single day for 60 years and I said okay  man I got it I'm gonna go be grateful so  that's I would recommend that I would  say don't don't look back to say okay  what am I gonna change what was the  thing look back with gratefulness on  every single thing you've had it going  on  and use that as a technique or a mantra  or a meditation for the future be  grateful and you will have amazing  success I love that that's a great  that's a great point that end on I  appreciate that Phil for people who want  to find you obviously you've got real  one invest we've link that up below are  you on social are you taking questions  how do how can people reach you yeah we  got a blog going we do a podcast it's  theirs just go to the website you'll see  all the different avenues who can get at  each other perfect thank you guys for  watching Phil thank you so much for  spending your time I am grateful for  that I am grateful as well namaste man I  love it continue to believe guys and  we'll see you soon
 

